# Project Rules - AI TRIGGER

## Service Goal
This project is a web program for monitoring potential US stock day momentum runners.

It does not provide buy/sell recommendations.
It does not provide entry price, target price, stop loss, or guaranteed profit.

The service provides:
- watchlist detection
- news event detection
- SEC risk check
- momentum persistence analysis
- short squeeze possibility grade
- live read-only trigger feed

## Architecture
- apps/web: Next.js + TypeScript + Tailwind web app
- worker: Python data pipeline, added later
- supabase: database schema, added later
- docs: planning documents

## MVP 1 Rule
For MVP 1, do not connect real APIs.
Use mock data only.

Do not connect:
- FMP
- Massive
- SEC
- Gemini
- Toss Payments
- Supabase Auth
- Google OAuth

## UI Rule
The web app should look like a Discord-style read-only live feed.
Users cannot write messages.
Only system/admin generated alerts are displayed.

## Service Structure
There is no free version.
Before payment, users see the public landing page.
After payment, users access the member-only trigger feed.
For MVP 1, payment is not connected and mock login can be used.

## Forbidden Words
Do not use:
- buy now
- sell now
- entry price
- target price
- stop loss
- guaranteed profit
- must buy
- guaranteed rise

Korean forbidden expressions:
- 매수하세요
- 매도하세요
- 진입가
- 목표가
- 손절가
- 무조건 상승
- 수익 보장
- 급등 확정

## Allowed Expressions
Use:
- 당일 급등 후보
- 이벤트 감지
- SEC 리스크
- 지속성 판단
- 관찰 필요
- 확인 범위 내 주요 리스크 미확인
- 수급 민감도
- 뉴스 강도
- 리스크 등급